    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's much better. It's much more professional. One thing though—I'm worried that if I just send this as a blunt paragraph, it might come across as a bit robotic or cold, and I don't want to kill their morale since they are such a high performer. Is there any way to add a bit of \"personality\" or a softer touch to the transition between the praise and the critique? Just something to make it feel less like a formal reprimand and more like a coaching moment?",
